    "title": "Single lane closure scheduled on WV 5, across Creston Bridge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Isabelle Poling ,\n8 hours ago Wirt County, WV (WTAP) - A single lane of WV 5 across the Creston Bridge in Wirt County will be closed for bridge inspection. The closure will be at milepost 13.05 on Aug. 31 and Sept 1 from 8 a.m. to 4 p.m. Motorists should reduce their speed, follow traffic... Read full article",
